# POS-ALL01 -- W4-FIX-POS acceptance (docs/gap/wave4/01-positioning.md):
# buildings draw with the SHP canvas centred on the ORIGIN cell's top vertex
# (FUN_00459ee0). Read the shots against docs/gap/wave4/01-evidence/ref/.
#   statue  the Statue of Liberty (CANEWY04 3x3, L6): the pedestal sits
#           centred on its star plinth, not spilling over its front edge
#   bridge  the high bridge (top right of the statue view): one deck
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL01T.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
assert bld.5.CANEWY04 >= 1
cheat view_building CANEWY04
wait 2
shot statue
cheat view_key ovl:BRIDGE 0
wait 2
shot bridge
